        ns2:claim "The paper explicitly frames predictive coding as a core concept alongside world models and discusses its role in cognitive robotics."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 8e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "Alternatively, in neuroscience, predictive coding proposes that the brain continuously predicts its inputs and adapts to model its own dynamics and control behavior in its environment."^^xsd:string ;
