<http://activeinference.institute/nanopub/379bbf4f5984#assertion> {
    <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/paper/doi_10.1007_978-3-030-64919-7_8> ns2:asserts <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/assertion/llm_doi_10.1007_978-3-030-64919-7_8_AIF_OPTIMALITY> .

