        ns2:prov_source_passage "By extracting hidden states during a model's forward pass, we calculate the ‘Cognitive Dissonance Delta’ -- the mathematical gap between an LLM’s outward semantic confidence (softmax probabilities) and its internal latent certainty (derived via linear probes)."^^xsd:string ;
