        ns2:claim "The paper introduces a framework for Radical Embodied Cognitive Neuroscience and uses the FEP within an ecological niche, suggesting broad applicability but doesn't explicitly state universal application."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 6e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "Thus amended, this principle is helpful for understanding the embeddedness of neurodynamics within the dynamics of the system 'brain-body-landscape of affordances.'"^^xsd:string ;
