        ns2:claim "The paper focuses on synaptic learning within a specific biological system (the brain) and applying the FEP to it. While broadly applicable, the paper doesn't explicitly address universality across *all* self-organizing systems."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 7e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "Specifically, we apply our theory to synaptic learning by considering it an inference problem under the FEP..."^^xsd:string ;
