    <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/paper/doi_10.1007_978-3-032-16955-6_19> ns2:asserts <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/assertion/llm_doi_10.1007_978-3-032-16955-6_19_SCALABILITY> .
