        ns2:evidenceType "empirical"^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:sourceClaim "However, current methods do not yet scale to high-dimensional inputs in continuous control. Here we present a novel active inference torque controller for industrial arms that maintains the adaptive characteristics of previous proprioceptive approaches but also enables large-scale multimodal integration (e.g., raw images)."^^xsd:string ;
