        ns2:claim "The paper focuses on deriving a specific formulation of active inference from control principles, not directly addressing the broader claim of universal applicability of the FEP."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 6e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "Our formulation returns to the roots of active inference in neuroanatomy and neurophysiology, formally reconnecting active inference to optimal feedback control."^^xsd:string ;
