<http://activeinference.institute/nanopub/cbc2f39b9d34#assertion> {
    <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/paper/doi_10.1111_j.1365-246x.1976.tb01253.x> ns2:asserts <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/assertion/llm_doi_10.1111_j.1365-246x.1976.tb01253.x_FEP_UNIVERSALITY> .

