        ns2:claim "The paper focuses on a specific application (multi-armed bandits) and doesn't directly address the broader claim of FEP universality across all self-organizing systems."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 6e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "…active inference algorithm does not produce efficient long-term behaviour in stationary bandits. However, in the more challenging switching bandit problem active inference performs substantially better than the two state-of-the-art bandit algorithms."^^xsd:string ;
