        ns2:claim "The paper discusses a knowledge market as a self-organizing system, aligning with the FEP's core principle of universal application to such systems. However, it doesn’t explicitly test or claim universality."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 6e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "It is possible to define them as value-exchange systems in which the dynamic features of the creation and exchange of intellectual assets serve as the fundamental drivers of the frequency, nature, and outcomes of interactions among various stakeholders."^^xsd:string ;
