    <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/paper/doi_10.1109_LRA.2024.3426183> ns2:asserts <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/assertion/llm_doi_10.1109_LRA.2024.3426183_FEP_UNIVERSALITY> .
