        ns2:evidenceType "theoretical"^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:sourceClaim "We use Bayesian lenses...to define fibrations of statistical games and classify various problems of statistical inference as corresponding sections: the chain rule of the relative entropy is formalized as a strict section, while maximum likelihood estimation and the free energy give lax sections."^^xsd:string .

