        ns2:claim "The paper focuses on a specific implementation of Active Inference (successor representations) and its performance in planning, not the broader universality of the FEP itself."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 6e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "An alternative, but less explored, model-free RL algorithm is the successor representation, which expresses the value function in terms of a successor matrix of expected future state occupancies."^^xsd:string ;
