        ns2:claim "The paper discusses applications of the FEP across machine learning and neuroscience, but doesn't explicitly state or argue for universal applicability."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 6e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "A core postulate of the theory is that complex systems can be seen as performing variational Bayesian inference and minimizing an information-theoretic quantity called the variational free energy."^^xsd:string ;
