        ns2:claim "The paper explicitly frames the FEP as a unifying principle for understanding adaptation across organisms and machines, suggesting its broad applicability."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 8e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "These provide a unified view on the adaptation of organisms to the environment."^^xsd:string ;
