        ns2:claim "The paper's core methodology – Bayesian pRF modeling and minimizing prediction error through model comparison – is a direct implementation of predictive coding."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 8e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "the framework enables the experimenter to specify generative (encoding) models of fMRI timeseries, in which experimental manipulations enter a pRF model of neural activity, which in turns drives a nonlinear model of neurovascular coupling and BOLD response."^^xsd:string ;
