        ns2:claim "The paper focuses on a specific implementation of BNNs and variational inference within the context of deep learning benchmarks. While it touches upon self-organization implicitly through the use of Bayesian networks, it doesn't directly address the universal applicability of the FEP itself."^^xsd:string ;
