        ns2:neutral <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/hypothesis/fep_universality> ;
        ns2:sourceClaim "The free energy principle, and its corollary active inference, constitute a bio-inspired theory that assumes biological agents act to remain in a restricted set of preferred states of the world, i.e., they minimize their free energy."^^xsd:string .

