        ns2:claim "The paper explicitly models teammates' decision processes (perception-belief-action) within an Active Inference framework, suggesting that this approach leads to optimal decision-making under uncertainty by minimizing prediction errors."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 8e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "\"Specifically, we model the teammate's decision process as follows: 1) Perception: observing environments; 2) Belief: forming beliefs; 3) Action: making decisions.\""^^xsd:string ;
