        ns2:evidenceType "theoretical"^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:sourceClaim "This letter first introduces the basic concepts of the FEP, followed by its historical development and connections with other theories of intelligence, and then delves into the specific application of the FEP to perception and decision making, encompassing both low-dimensional simple situations and high-dimensional complex situations."^^xsd:string ;
