        ns2:supports <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/hypothesis/predictive_coding> .

    <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/paper/arxiv_2109.04139> ns2:asserts <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/assertion/llm_arxiv_2109.04139_PREDICTIVE_CODING> .
