        ns2:confidence 6e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "Recent work proposed a hierarchical active inference model for navigation, where the low level model makes inferences about hidden states and poses that explain sensory inputs, whereas the high level model makes inferences about moving between locations, effectively building a map of the environment."^^xsd:string ;
