        ns2:sourceClaim "Here we review recent work attempting to combine the first principles formalism of the Free Energy Principle and Active Inference (FEP-AI) framework with a recently proposed integrative model that attempts to ground personality as control variables for goal-seeking systems: Cybernetic Big 5 Theory (CB5T)."^^xsd:string .
