        ns2:supports <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/hypothesis/aif_optimality> .

    <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/paper/arxiv_2308.08029> ns2:asserts <http://activeinference.institute/ontology/assertion/llm_arxiv_2308.08029_AIF_OPTIMALITY> .
