        ns2:claim "The paper describes AI as variational free energy minimization to achieve purposeful behavior, implying optimal decision-making."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 8e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "However, manual derivations for free energy minimizing algorithms on custom dynamic models can become tedious and error-prone."^^xsd:string ;
