        ns2:claim "The paper's simulation focuses on how Active Inference agents (simulated NFT participants) respond to feedback and prior beliefs, directly testing the core assumption of AIF – that agents optimize their decisions based on minimizing free energy."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 8e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "Simulations show that training effectiveness is sensitive to feedback noise or bias, and to prior beliefs (highlighting the importance of guiding instructions)"^^xsd:string ;
