        ns2:claim "The paper frames active inference as a mechanism for minimizing free energy, implying optimal decision-making in an uncertain environment."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 8e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "This means that evidence for competing hypotheses about the scene has to be accumulated sequentially, calling upon both prediction (planning) and postdiction (memory)."^^xsd:string ;
