        ns2:claim "The paper discusses a new management methodology for distributed systems but doesn't explicitly connect this to the broader FEP’s claim of universality. It focuses on a specific system type (computing continuum) and its management challenges."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 6e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "These systems are concurrently executed in multiple computing tiers: Cloud, Fog, Edge and IoT. This simple idea develops manifold challenges due to the inherent complexity inherited from the underlying infrastructures of these systems."^^xsd:string ;
