        ns2:claim "The paper discusses design patterns as shared priors, a concept central to the FEP's claim of universal self-organization. However, it doesn’t explicitly test or confirm this universality."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 6e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "Drawing on the Active Inference Framework, we illustrate how patterns can guide agent behavior without fully prescribing it."^^xsd:string ;
