        ns2:claim "The paper discusses the FEP in a general context but doesn't directly test its universality."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 6e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "Combining the data from research in neuroimaging of schizophrenia patients with the Freudian hypothesis, we propose considering the hyperactivity of the DMN as a consequence of a process of massive reassociation of traces occurring in schizophrenia."^^xsd:string ;
