        ns2:claim "The paper discusses mapping Husserlian phenomenology onto active inference, a specific instantiation of the FEP. It doesn't directly address the universality claim itself but lays groundwork for potentially broader applications."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 6e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "In this paper, we re-examine elements of Husserlian phenomenology through the lens of active inference. In doing so, we aim to advance the project of computational phenomenology, as recently outlined by proponents of active inference."^^xsd:string ;
