        ns2:claim "The paper focuses on neuronal dynamics within a biological system and doesn't explicitly address the universality of the FEP across all self-organizing systems."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 6e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "It specifies neuronal dynamics for state-estimation in terms of a descent on (variational) free energy—a measure of the fit between an internal (generative) model and sensory observations."^^xsd:string ;
