        ns2:claim "The paper presents a formal treatment of choice based on the FEP, but doesn't explicitly address its universal applicability beyond agents with goals and uncertainty."^^xsd:string ;
        ns2:confidence 7e-01 ;
        ns2:evidenceQuote "Crucially, the negative free energy or quality of a policy can be decomposed into extrinsic and epistemic (or intrinsic) value."^^xsd:string ;
